    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>As a Bonus Action while holding this ventriloquist’s dummy, you can pull the cord on its back to make it float to an unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of yourself and hover there. While it hovers, you can take a Bonus Action to move it up to 30 feet to another unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The doll hovers for 1 minute or until you end the effect as a Bonus Action.</p><p>While the doll is within 30 feet of you, you can speak through its mouth instead of your own—letting you cast a spell with a Verbal component even if you can’t speak, for example.</p>",
